  "items": [
    {
      "name": "Here's the surprising part",
      "char_file": "손가락_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A blood vessel breaks",
        "under the clear surface",
        "of your eye",
        "",
        "and most people notice it",
        "in the mirror - not from pain"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "It's called the Valsalva effect",
      "char_file": "변기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Straining that suddenly raises",
        "pressure in your chest",
        "",
        "pushes that pressure right",
        "into the vessels around your eyes"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Coughing, sneezing, and more",
      "char_file": "변기_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "A hard cough, a sneeze,",
        "vomiting, heavy lifting,",
        "even straining on the toilet",
        "",
        "any of these can be enough",
        "to break a fragile vessel"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Rubbing and contact lenses",
      "char_file": "손가락_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Rubbing itchy or tired eyes,",
        "or pressing hard when you",
        "put in contacts,",
        "",
        "adds direct pressure",
        "of its own"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Ease up like this",
      "char_file": "인공눈물_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Swap rubbing for",
        "preservative-free artificial tears",
        "",
        "and handle your lenses",
        "gently going in and out"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "On aspirin or blood thinners",
      "char_file": "아스피린_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "These keep your blood",
        "from clotting normally",
        "",
        "so a small break bleeds",
        "more and clears more slowly"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Here's the safe way to handle it",
      "char_file": "혈압계_illust.jpg",
      "body": [
        "Don't stop them on your own -",
        "check with your doctor first",
        "",
        "and reach for acetaminophen,",
        "not aspirin, for eye discomfort"
      ]
    }
  ],
